<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-ITALY TOUR GAME CALLED OFF.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ITALY TOUR GAME CALLED OFF.</headline>
<dateline>LLANELLI, Wales 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's hopes of a warm-up match ahead of Saturday's rugby union international against Ireland in Dublin have been thwarted by bad weather.</p>
<p>Their clash with Llanelli at Stradey Park on Tuesday was called off because of a frozen pitch.</p>
</text>
